WEBVTT

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.280
A dream...?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.730
No...

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:59.300
This isn't a dream...

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.010
I did that...

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:14.020
Chapter 22

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:14.020
Confusion

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:24.350
That girl...

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.960
Why now of all times?

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.220
No.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.500
That's not the issue.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:37.780
The issue is...

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:45.100
I put His Highness in danger, despite being right beside him.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.090
I won't...

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.710
I won't be defeated again.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:00.810
Please!

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.780
Tell me where Alicia is!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.270
No, I can't.

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.770
Why not?!

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.100
I just want to talk to her!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.830
The brass gave us strict orders.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.790
Just help me out a bit here!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.580
You're pretty damn persistent.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.110
No means no!

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.080
What're you doing, Commander?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.900
Oh, Zaka.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.380
Doing maintenance on the Edelweiss?

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.670
Nope.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:50.020
I'm observing someone who's daydreaming{stoning around}, even though he should be the busiest out of all of us.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.160
I've never felt like this before.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:57.970
If a person's too busy, he won't know what to do anymore.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:05.330
Are you okay with not seeing Alicia? {Shouldn't you be seeing Alicia?}

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.010
The guys up top aren't letting anyone see her.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.350
They won't even tell me where she is.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.140
It's okay.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:18.970
If I can't see her in person, I'll think of another way.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:23.220
I'm thinking about what I should start with.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.070
I see.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.660
That's good.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.080
But things aren't so simple.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.060
What happened was pretty insane, after all.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.560
But I'll never give up.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.300
I want to see Alicia.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.460
Needless to say, everyone knows the topic at hand.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.830
It's regarding Sergeant Alicia Melchiott from the militia's Squad 7.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:51.080
At the Battle of Naggiar Plains, she demonstrated a power that belongs exclusively to the Valkyrur.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.640
Cut the formalities.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.290
The question is: how are we going to make use of her power?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.200
There's no need to think about it. {Duh. It's simple}

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.810
We'll annihilate the Empire with her power.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.020
Arrange for her transfer immediately.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:07.650
From today onwards, she'll be part of the regular army.

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:10.530
Aren't you going to consult her first? {about that decision}

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.210
You saw it too, didn't you?

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:16.640
With her power, we can significantly change the tide of battle.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.600
She's human, not a weapon!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.140
To us, she's a weapon.

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.760
And quite a powerful one at that.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.610
The Empire's not the only one that's crippled.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.370
We've suffered as well.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:31.890
It's obvious that we should make good use of her.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:32.710
But...

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.070
Do you have a better idea?

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:37.390
At the very least, consult her first.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.880
That's not necessary. It's already decided.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:46.550
I never thought there'd be such a monster in our ranks. {in our subordinates}

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.060
I'll make full use of her.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:52.430
No objections, correct?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.700
The meeting is over.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.460
Make the necessary arrangements immediately.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.460
Yes, sir.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.610
I have permission.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:13.980
Let me enter.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.120
Go ahead.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.020
It's you, Welkin.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.240
I have something to ask you.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.660
Why did you do that?

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.530
That?

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.800
What are you referring to?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.920
The fact that I helplessly watched my subordinates die and survived?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.620
The fact that I kidnapped Princess Cordelia?

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:51.870
Or...

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.420
the fact that I shot Alicia?

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.250
You shot... Alicia?

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.610
No way...

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.660
That's a lie.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.370
Why?

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.900
Why, you ask?

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:09.610
It's hard to explain why.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:17.340
To awaken the power of the Valkyrur,

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:21.010
she'd have to be on the verge of death.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:25.710
Then, the blood of the Valkyrur will awaken within her.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.670
Basically, you...

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:31.690
I've noticed some clues for a while now.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:34.370
Although I was pretty certain...

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:36.670
I'm still glad I wasn't mistaken.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.750
Because of that, you...

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:44.500
That spear and shield can amplify a Valkyria's power.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.750
I went through a lot to obtain them.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.690
You did such a thing to Alicia all for that...

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.900
Have you forgotten?

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.980
We narrowly escaped annihilation because of it.

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:57.640
If she hadn't awoken...

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:58.520
We'd be...

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.020
That's not the point!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.650
What then?

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:21.690
I couldn't sit by and watch as everyone around me died.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.710
I was wrong about you,

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:27.940
Faldio!

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.040
So tell me then,

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.370
Welkin.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.910
What...

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.910
What should I have done?

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.610
Welkin.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.580
From now on,

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:54.240
she'll probably have to go through a lot.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.930
Whether she wishes it or not.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.810
If possible...

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:02.330
Please support her.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:03.840
Please!

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:36.260
Please tell me if you need anything.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.870
I'll be off then.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.010
Umm...

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.730
Oh, sorry about that.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:46.960
What is it?

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:51.400
When can I return to the squad?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.860
I-I'm not sure. I'm not...

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:58.020
Then, can everyone... No.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.120
Can I go outside?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.440
Sorry. I'm not sure about that either.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.620
I can help you ask around, though.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.520
If you'll excuse me...

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.030
This is a pretty serious situation we have here.

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:21.130
We lost the battle at the Naggiar Plains that we should've won.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:24.070
On top of that, we lost the Batomys.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:28.830
Our biggest mistake was that we'd never predicted that the enemy would have a Valkyria on their side.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:39.610
Say, Maximilian.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:43.090
Shouldn't you be feeling a bit of pressure now?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:47.360
I never thought you of all people would worry about me.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:52.040
Well, I suppose you're all right if you can joke around like that.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:56.310
However, those guys from Central won't turn a blind eye to this.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:11:00.580
Shouldn't Naggiar have been our last chance?

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:04.710
None of what Central says matters.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:07.750
The result of the war is all that matters, after all.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:11.690
I'm only worried because there's no such "result" for us.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.690
Don't worry. I still have a trump card.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:19.340
I'll make sure Gallia becomes mine.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.870
Well, all I can do is trust you.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:26.510
Speaking of which, Maximilian.

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:29.290
Have you spoken with Selvaria?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.320
What?

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:36.760
Excuse me.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.650
The Engineering Division has sent an urgent telegram.

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:43.680
Read it.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.000
Yes, sir.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.170
The mythical beast...

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.580
The mythical beast has awoken from its slumber.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.520
That is all.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.480
I see.

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:56.440
Looks like they made it in time.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:21.090
I can't go outside or contact anyone.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.800
It's like a prison in disguise.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.970
I wonder how everyone's doing.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.690
Welkin?

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:37.390
How have you been, Alicia Melchiott?

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:40.820
I'm asking you how you feel.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.110
Forget it.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:48.640
More importantly, today's your lucky day.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:52.570
I came here personally to tell you that.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.710
Alicia Melchiott.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:13:01.030
From today onwards, you'll be transferred to First Battalion, the core of the regular army.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:05.140
At the same time, you will be promoted four ranks to the rank of captain.

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.320
That is all.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.140
Please change into this.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.560
What's the meaning of this?

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.220
It's just as he says.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:17.480
From now on, you'll be part of the regular army!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.310
Wait a minute! I can't...

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:24.440
We, the highest-ranked commanders, hold you in high esteem.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.550
Consider it an honor to transfer into the regular army.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.870
I don't want to! Why should I...

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.960
Think about it carefully.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:36.630
You displayed such fearsome power in front of everyone.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:40.220
Did you think you could remain in your current squad?

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:43.990
People now look at you in a different light.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.670
In other words, you don't belong there anymore.

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:50.810
No way...

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.390
This is for your own good as well.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.310
Plus, your commander has agreed to it.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.520
Welkin did?

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.910
That's right.

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:04.260
2nd Lieutenant Welkin Gunther agreed as well.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.030
That's a lie...

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.990
It's not a lie. I'm telling the-

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:13.160
Welkin would never say that!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:14.520
Hey, wait!

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.320
S-Stop!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.190
You...

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.750
It's useless. Forget it.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.540
She's a Valkyria.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.390
It's already been decided!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.990
Complaining about it won't get you anywhere!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:31.710
No way! Welkin wouldn't agree to this!

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:35.210
Neither would everyone else! We're comrades who've always been fighting together!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.390
They're like family to me!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:56.580
You guys...

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:02.000
Is it about Alicia?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.910
How should I put it?

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:08.220
We feel that it's better to learn more, so we can make a decision.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.160
Indeed, you should.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.980
Please tell us.

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.120
What's going on with Alicia?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.180
Alicia is...

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:21.560
She's a descendant of the Valkyrur.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.400
Valkyrur... By Valkyrur, you mean those?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.810
Is it still okay for her to be with us?

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:29.360
Wait a second, Edy.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.380
Didn't you say that earlier? This is serious.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.280
I did say that, but...

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:38.220
Actually, everyone's confused.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:41.080
I understand. I'm at a loss as well.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:46.480
In any event, we'd better decide what we're going to do from now on.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:50.950
But people from other squads called Alicia a monster.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.090
Hey, Emile!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.260
Sorry.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.690
But what can we do about it?

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:01.380
Is Alicia still the person we all know and love?

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:02.740
You guys!

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:06.090
You should know what would have happened to us if Alicia wasn't here!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:10.050
We know! But this and that are two different things!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:12.150
Alicia's scary!

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:14.630
I don't have the confidence...

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:17.410
I don't know how I'm going to get along with her from now on.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:21.290
Me too...  I don't know if I can talk to Alicia normally.

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.650
I feel the same way too.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.400
Everyone, I can understand your anxiety.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:27.660
But...

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:35.950
Alicia!

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.240
She heard all that?

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.350
Alicia.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.330
Sorry...

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:48.570
I...

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:53.030
W-Well, I'm just here to say hello to you guys.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.480
I'm going to be transferred to the regular army.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.430
I've been promoted a few ranks too.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.990
I've become a high-ranking officer.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:05.540
Sorry...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.590
What am I saying?

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:17.430
I just wanted to tell you all...

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:24.100
Thanks for everything until now.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:28.190
Bye!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.150
Wait!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.410
Wait, Alicia!

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:46.070
Let go of me!

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.510
Alicia!

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.100
Listen to me!

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.680
I told you to let go of me!

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:57.440
Everyone's just a bit confused right now.

00:17:57.440 --> 00:18:00.570
If we explain everything, they'll definitely understand.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:03.850
It's useless! I don't belong there anymore!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.620
You're wrong!

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:08.500
Because... Alicia, you're our comrade!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:14.410
We've been fighting together for so long.

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:17.730
We've been through many tough times together, haven't we?

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.260
That's why we'll definitely get through this!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.200
Right?

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.650
Alicia.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.590
When I lost Isara and lost myself in sorrow,

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:36.370
you were the one who took care of me.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:39.660
Because of you,

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:42.530
I was able to get a grip on myself.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:47.560
That's why I want to be here for you!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:52.980
Alicia...

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.690
You don't understand, Welkin.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:09.880
Alicia...

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.210
What're you...

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:18.340
The Alicia Melchiott you knew is gone for good.

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.080
I'm...

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:27.630
...a monster.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.180
Farewell, Welkin.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.150
Wait!

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:37.010
Stay away!

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:41.990
Please.

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:12.760
I am Georg von Damon.

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:14.880
My rank is general.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.660
The ignorant call me foolish.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:24.710
Those ignorant fools don't know how tough it is to protect a country!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:25.980
So I ask:

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:29.500
"What exactly can you do?"

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.740
Next time on Valkyria Chronicles,

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:35.080
Chapter 23: Form of Love.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.490
The Valkyrur are always watching over us, the Principality of Gallia!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:40.020
Chapter 23

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:40.020
Form of Love
